            <milestone unit="section" n="1"/>The land of <placeName ref="https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/570182" key="corinth">Corinth<note>The city, not the gulf.</note></placeName>
            is a part of the Argive land.
            <milestone unit="section" n="2"/>Near it lies
