          <pb n="13"/>
          <p>The road runs on to <placeName ref="https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/570700"><settlement>Sikyon</settlement></placeName>,
            <note>Some editors read <placeName ref="https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/570642">Phlious</placeName> here.</note>
